            <div class="faq-q-and-a__accordion-content accordion__content" id="93ac6856ee464429bb582259d60b3f27" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
               <div class="faq-q-and-a__accordion-content-wrapper">
                  <div itemprop="text"><p>Most other toothbrushes just brush, missing the gaps between the teeth. Many people then do not floss afterwards. With the Dyson CameraJet™ toothbrush, you can automatically floss the gaps while you brush, removing more plaque than a manual toothbrush.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Only Dyson’s electric toothbrush has a camera powered by Gap Optical Targeting™ to accurately identify, target and precision-floss gaps between teeth.¹ Dyson’s unique variable sonic oscillation keeps bristles in constant motion to remove more plaque.⁷</p>
</div>
                  
