                  <div itemprop="text"><p>Yes, the Dyson CameraJet™ toothbrush has three cleaning modes: Auto-jet and Brush, Auto-jet only, and Brush only. You can also choose from three Brush intensity modes (Gentle, Variable, and Deep clean) for a more personalised experience.</p>
