               <div class="faq-q-and-a__accordion-content-wrapper">
                  <div itemprop="text"><p>The Dyson CameraJet™ toothbrush has been engineered with soft-to-medium stiffness end-rounded bristles for comfort while brushing, including for users with sensitive gums or gum disease. A Sensitive dual-bristle brush head is also available, which has softer bristles designed to be gentler on gums and enamel. For users with sensitive teeth, we also recommend using Dyson’s Sensitive non-foaming toothpaste.</p>
